WEBVTT

00:04:58.163 --> 00:05:01.430
but it's OK because you feel
cheaply and quickly.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:04.497
You iterate, you pivot,
you adapt your idea.

00:05:04.497 --> 00:05:07.763
You might go and make a brochure of

00:05:07.763 --> 00:05:10.097
a nonexisting product to
make it feel real.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.463
Your customers still say you don't
understand. You adapt it.

00:05:13.463 --> 00:05:18.530
You constantly adapt. And only when you
have enough evidence do you go and build

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.097
a technological prototype.

00:05:20.397 --> 00:05:26.397
So you increase your investment with the
decrease of risk and uncertainty.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.330
And you use this business
model canvas like

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:32.897
a scoreboard where you map
out your first idea,